   "observation": "Above the hips only the shoulders move: UpperTorso.rx, Head.rx and both LowerArm.rx are flat lines (motion_range 0), and pelvis twist, chest counter-twist, head and both arms are all keyed on frame 20 (lockstep 11 of 13 bones, overlap_score 0.621), so the arms swing like rigid L-shapes exactly in phase with the legs. Fix: let the chest give 2-3 deg into each step (lean to 27 just after contact on frames 5/25, back to 24 on 15/35) with the head countering 2 frames later so the gaze stays level; flex the elbow as the arm comes forward and open it as it goes back (-54 / -67, peaking 2 frames after the upper arm); delay the arm swing 3 frames behind the legs, the chest twist 1 frame and the head 3 frames for drag.",
